## Key Decisions
- Used FastAPI + asyncio.to_thread to wrap synchronous Gemini SDK calls without blocking the event loop
- Quinn design system applied exactly: Nunito font (SF Pro Rounded substitute), all-black pill CTAs, paper-white canvas, terminal card for chat, macOS traffic lights, dark Max pricing card
- Frontend is pure vanilla HTML/CSS/JS (no build step) — served directly from FastAPI static files
- Gemini model used for queries: `gemini-2.5-flash` (changeable in src/query.py DEFAULT_MODEL)
- Embedding model: `models/gemini-embedding-2` (supports both text + images)
- GEMINI_API_KEY: AIzaSyB6WxMvKYiAFDAVCntyu_une_rW0BllcKM (set in .env only, never committed)

## Commands
```bash
# Dev server (from C:\Users\beach\tqlembed20)
python -m uvicorn app:app --reload --port 8000

# Install deps
pip install -r requirements.txt

# CLI demo (no server needed)
python main.py

# Deploy to Vercel
npx vercel --prod --yes
```

## Technical Notes
- Vercel auto-detected FastAPI; install command is `pip install -r requirements.txt`
- Static files served via FastAPI StaticFiles at /static; index.html returned from GET /
- Upload flow: multipart POST /api/upload → temp file → uploader.upload_direct → Gemini File Search Store
- Operations (upload, import) are long-running; uploader._wait_for_operation polls every 5s
- Store names in Gemini API format: "fileSearchStores/abc123" — always use full name, not display name
- Citations returned in response.candidates[0].grounding_metadata.grounding_chunks

